From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 07 Nov 2026 22:33:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] rtl837x: fix unlocked table error

Reject unsupported L2 read methods before locking without unlocking a mutex that has not been acquired.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/src/rtl837x_table.c
+++ b/src/rtl837x_table.c
@@ -60,8 +60,7 @@ int rtl837x_ita_execute(struct realtek_p
 				write_data = true;
 				break;
 			default:
-				ret = -EINVAL;
-				goto out;
+				return -EINVAL;
 			}
 		} else if (opera == RTL837X_TABLE_OPERA_DELETE) {
 			cmd |= FIELD_PREP(RTL837X_TABLE_CTRL_ADDR_MASK, *addr);
